    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/sblgnt/2tim#2Tim.1.2",
    "work_id": "scripture/sblgnt/2tim",
    "canonical_ref": "2Tim.1.2",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Τιμοθέῳ ἀγαπητῷ τέκνῳ· χάρις, ἔλεος, εἰρήνη ἀπὸ θεοῦ πατρὸς καὶ Χριστοῦ Ἰησοῦ τοῦ κυρίου ἡμῶν.",
    "chunk_index": 1,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 65,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      100
    ],
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/sblgnt/2tim#2Tim.1.3",
    "work_id": "scripture/sblgnt/2tim",
    "canonical_ref": "2Tim.1.3",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Χάριν ἔχω τῷ θεῷ, ᾧ λατρεύω ἀπὸ προγόνων ἐν καθαρᾷ συνειδήσει, ὡς ἀδιάλειπτον ἔχω τὴν περὶ σοῦ μνείαν ἐν ταῖς δεήσεσίν μου, νυκτὸς καὶ ἡμέρας",
    "chunk_index": 2,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 65,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      100
    ],
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/sblgnt/2tim#2Tim.1.4",
    "work_id": "scripture/sblgnt/2tim",
    "canonical_ref": "2Tim.1.4",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "ἐπιποθῶν σε ἰδεῖν, μεμνημένος σου τῶν δακρύων, ἵνα χαρᾶς πληρωθῶ",
    "chunk_index": 3,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 65,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      100
    ],
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/sblgnt/2tim#2Tim.1.5",
    "work_id": "scripture/sblgnt/2tim",
    "canonical_ref": "2Tim.1.5",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "ὑπόμνησιν λαβὼν τῆς ἐν σοὶ ἀνυποκρίτου πίστεως, ἥτις ἐνῴκησεν πρῶτον ἐν τῇ μάμμῃ σου Λωΐδι καὶ τῇ μητρί σου Εὐνίκῃ, πέπεισμαι δὲ ὅτι καὶ ἐν σοί.",
    "chunk_index": 4,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 65,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      100
    ],
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/sblgnt/2tim#2Tim.1.6",
    "work_id": "scripture/sblgnt/2tim",
    "canonical_ref": "2Tim.1.6",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "διʼ ἣν αἰτίαν ἀναμιμνῄσκω σε ἀναζωπυρεῖν τὸ χάρισμα τοῦ θεοῦ, ὅ ἐστιν ἐν σοὶ διὰ τῆς ἐπιθέσεως τῶν χειρῶν μου·",
    "chunk_index": 5,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 65,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      100
    ],
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/sblgnt/2tim#2Tim.1.7",
    "work_id": "scripture/sblgnt/2tim",
    "canonical_ref": "2Tim.1.7",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "οὐ γὰρ ἔδωκεν ἡμῖν ὁ θεὸς πνεῦμα δειλίας, ἀλλὰ δυνάμεως καὶ ἀγάπης καὶ σωφρονισμοῦ.",
    "chunk_index": 6,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 65,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      100
    ],
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/sblgnt/2tim#2Tim.1.8",
    "work_id": "scripture/sblgnt/2tim",
    "canonical_ref": "2Tim.1.8",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Μὴ οὖν ἐπαισχυνθῇς τὸ μαρτύριον τοῦ κυρίου ἡμῶν μηδὲ ἐμὲ τὸν δέσμιον αὐτοῦ, ἀλλὰ συγκακοπάθησον τῷ εὐαγγελίῳ κατὰ δύναμιν θεοῦ,",
    "chunk_index": 7,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 65,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      100
    ],
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/sblgnt/2tim#2Tim.1.9",
    "work_id": "scripture/sblgnt/2tim",
    "canonical_ref": "2Tim.1.9",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "τοῦ σώσαντος ἡμᾶς καὶ καλέσαντος κλήσει ἁγίᾳ, οὐ κατὰ τὰ ἔργα ἡμῶν ἀλλὰ κατὰ ἰδίαν πρόθεσιν καὶ χάριν, τὴν δοθεῖσαν ἡμῖν ἐν Χριστῷ Ἰησοῦ πρὸ χρόνων αἰωνίων,",
    "chunk_index": 8,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 65,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      100
    ],
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/sblgnt/2tim#2Tim.1.10",
    "work_id": "scripture/sblgnt/2tim",
    "canonical_ref": "2Tim.1.10",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "φανερωθεῖσαν δὲ νῦν διὰ τῆς ἐπιφανείας τοῦ σωτῆρος ἡμῶν Ἰησοῦ Χριστοῦ⸃, καταργήσαντος μὲν τὸν θάνατον φωτίσαντος δὲ ζωὴν καὶ ἀφθαρσίαν διὰ τοῦ εὐαγγελίου,",
    "chunk_index": 9,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 65,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      100
    ],
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/sblgnt/2tim#2Tim.1.11",
    "work_id": "scripture/sblgnt/2tim",
    "canonical_ref": "2Tim.1.11",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "εἰς ὃ ἐτέθην ἐγὼ κῆρυξ καὶ ἀπόστολος καὶ διδάσκαλος.",
    "chunk_index": 10,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 65,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      100
    ],
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/sblgnt/2tim#2Tim.1.12",
    "work_id": "scripture/sblgnt/2tim",
    "canonical_ref": "2Tim.1.12",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "διʼ ἣν αἰτίαν καὶ ταῦτα πάσχω, ἀλλʼ οὐκ ἐπαισχύνομαι, οἶδα γὰρ ᾧ πεπίστευκα, καὶ πέπεισμαι ὅτι δυνατός ἐστιν τὴν παραθήκην μου φυλάξαι εἰς ἐκείνην τὴν ἡμέραν.",
    "chunk_index": 11,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 65,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      100
    ],
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/sblgnt/2tim#2Tim.1.13",
    "work_id": "scripture/sblgnt/2tim",
    "canonical_ref": "2Tim.1.13",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "ὑποτύπωσιν ἔχε ὑγιαινόντων λόγων ὧν παρʼ ἐμοῦ ἤκουσας ἐν πίστει καὶ ἀγάπῃ τῇ ἐν Χριστῷ Ἰησοῦ·",
    "chunk_index": 12,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 65,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      100
    ],
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/sblgnt/2tim#2Tim.1.14",
    "work_id": "scripture/sblgnt/2tim",
    "canonical_ref": "2Tim.1.14",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "τὴν καλὴν παραθήκην φύλαξον διὰ πνεύματος ἁγίου τοῦ ἐνοικοῦντος ἐν ἡμῖν.",
    "chunk_index": 13,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 65,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      100
    ],
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/sblgnt/2tim#2Tim.1.15",
    "work_id": "scripture/sblgnt/2tim",
    "canonical_ref": "2Tim.1.15",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Οἶδας τοῦτο ὅτι ἀπεστράφησάν με πάντες οἱ ἐν τῇ Ἀσίᾳ, ὧν ἐστιν Φύγελος καὶ Ἑρμογένης.",
    "chunk_index": 14,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 65,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      100
    ],
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/sblgnt/2tim#2Tim.1.16",
    "work_id": "scripture/sblgnt/2tim",
    "canonical_ref": "2Tim.1.16",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "δῴη ἔλεος ὁ κύριος τῷ Ὀνησιφόρου οἴκῳ, ὅτι πολλάκις με ἀνέψυξεν, καὶ τὴν ἅλυσίν μου οὐκ ἐπαισχύνθη·",
    "chunk_index": 15,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 65,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      100
    ],
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/sblgnt/2tim#2Tim.1.17",
    "work_id": "scripture/sblgnt/2tim",
    "canonical_ref": "2Tim.1.17",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "ἀλλὰ γενόμενος ἐν Ῥώμῃ σπουδαίως ἐζήτησέν με καὶ εὗρεν—",
    "chunk_index": 16,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 65,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      100
    ],
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/sblgnt/2tim#2Tim.1.18",
    "work_id": "scripture/sblgnt/2tim",
    "canonical_ref": "2Tim.1.18",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "δῴη αὐτῷ ὁ κύριος εὑρεῖν ἔλεος παρὰ κυρίου ἐν ἐκείνῃ τῇ ἡμέρᾳ— καὶ ὅσα ἐν Ἐφέσῳ διηκόνησεν, βέλτιον σὺ γινώσκεις.",
    "chunk_index": 17,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 65,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      100
    ],
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/sblgnt/2tim#2Tim.2.1",
    "work_id": "scripture/sblgnt/2tim",
    "canonical_ref": "2Tim.2.1",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Σὺ οὖν, τέκνον μου, ἐνδυναμοῦ ἐν τῇ χάριτι τῇ ἐν Χριστῷ Ἰησοῦ,",
    "chunk_index": 18,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 65,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      100
    ],
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/sblgnt/2tim#2Tim.2.2",
    "work_id": "scripture/sblgnt/2tim",
    "canonical_ref": "2Tim.2.2",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "καὶ ἃ ἤκουσας παρʼ ἐμοῦ διὰ πολλῶν μαρτύρων, ταῦτα παράθου πιστοῖς ἀνθρώποις, οἵτινες ἱκανοὶ ἔσονται καὶ ἑτέρους διδάξαι.",
    "chunk_index": 19,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 65,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      100
    ],
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/sblgnt/2tim#2Tim.2.3",
    "work_id": "scripture/sblgnt/2tim",
    "canonical_ref": "2Tim.2.3",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "συγκακοπάθησον ὡς καλὸς στρατιώτης Χριστοῦ Ἰησοῦ⸃.",
    "chunk_index": 20,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 65,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      100
    ],
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/sblgnt/2tim#2Tim.2.4",
    "work_id": "scripture/sblgnt/2tim",
    "canonical_ref": "2Tim.2.4",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "οὐδεὶς στρατευόμενος ἐμπλέκεται ταῖς τοῦ βίου πραγματείαις, ἵνα τῷ στρατολογήσαντι ἀρέσῃ·",
    "chunk_index": 21,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 65,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      100
    ],
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
