  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/sblgnt/2tim#2Tim.2.7",
    "work_id": "scripture/sblgnt/2tim",
    "canonical_ref": "2Tim.2.7",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "νόει ὃ λέγω· δώσει γάρ σοι ὁ κύριος σύνεσιν ἐν πᾶσιν.",
    "chunk_index": 24,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 65,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      100
    ],
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/sblgnt/2tim#2Tim.2.8",
    "work_id": "scripture/sblgnt/2tim",
    "canonical_ref": "2Tim.2.8",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "Μνημόνευε Ἰησοῦν Χριστὸν ἐγηγερμένον ἐκ νεκρῶν, ἐκ σπέρματος Δαυίδ, κατὰ τὸ εὐαγγέλιόν μου·",
    "chunk_index": 25,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 65,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      100
    ],
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/sblgnt/2tim#2Tim.2.9",
    "work_id": "scripture/sblgnt/2tim",
    "canonical_ref": "2Tim.2.9",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "ἐν ᾧ κακοπαθῶ μέχρι δεσμῶν ὡς κακοῦργος. ἀλλὰ ὁ λόγος τοῦ θεοῦ οὐ δέδεται·",
    "chunk_index": 26,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 65,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      100
    ],
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/sblgnt/2tim#2Tim.2.10",
    "work_id": "scripture/sblgnt/2tim",
    "canonical_ref": "2Tim.2.10",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "διὰ τοῦτο πάντα ὑπομένω διὰ τοὺς ἐκλεκτούς, ἵνα καὶ αὐτοὶ σωτηρίας τύχωσιν τῆς ἐν Χριστῷ Ἰησοῦ μετὰ δόξης αἰωνίου.",
    "chunk_index": 27,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 65,
    "date_range": [
      60,
      100
    ],
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "post_schism": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "scripture/sblgnt/2tim#2Tim.2.11",
    "work_id": "scripture/sblgnt/2tim",
    "canonical_ref": "2Tim.2.11",
    "language": "grc",
    "text": "πιστὸς ὁ λόγος· εἰ γὰρ συναπεθάνομεν, καὶ συζήσομεν·",
    "chunk_index": 28,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 65,
    "date_range": [
      60,
